# Devnet sandbox build (`npm run build:devnet` / `deploy:devnet`) — deployed only to
# devnet.otchub.dev (see ../wrangler.jsonc `env.devnet`). Public values only, safe to commit:
# a public RPC endpoint and the devnet program id, both already public knowledge on-chain.
#
# For a faster/more reliable RPC than the public devnet endpoint, override in `.env.devnet.local`
# (gitignored, never committed) — e.g. a Helius devnet URL:
# VITE_HUB_RPC_URL=https://devnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=<HELIUS_API_KEY>
VITE_HUB_RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
VITE_HUB_CLUSTER=devnet
VITE_HUB_PROGRAM_ID=7c5oPs9GvX8vrC5jVFketNx1ZLuPs7HeH8Qc4XJx7b7i
